WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.674
"Stop!" Ben called to the zombies.

2
00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:07.982
The two monsters jumped at the sound of his voice.

3
00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:12.443
Then they dashed across the lobby, racing toward the construction area.

4
00:00:12.444 --> 00:00:16.629
They dodged into the construction with Ben following behind.

5
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.355
"Come back here!" Ben shouted.

6
00:00:19.356 --> 00:00:24.074
It was dark, and the zombies were a good distance away from him.

7
00:00:24.082 --> 00:00:30.766
But these zombies were taller than the zombies at Monster Academy, and— Brrpp!

8
00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:35.408
Brrpp! Suddenly an alarm blared and lights flashed on. Brrpp!

9
00:00:35.409 --> 00:00:38.453
Brrpp! "Don't move!" yelled a stern

10
00:00:38.454 --> 00:00:46.655
voice. Ben froze in terror as two museum guards ran toward

11
00:00:46.656 --> 00:00:52.752
him. "We caught a thief!" said one guard. His nametag read

12
00:00:52.753 --> 00:00:58.629
Bob. "It's a ghost!" said the other one. Her name was

13
00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:01.362
Hazel. "B-b-but . . . It wasn't

14
00:01:01.363 --> 00:01:06.068
me!" Ben tried to explain everything, but the guards just stared at

15
00:01:06.069 --> 00:01:09.488
him. "Don't try to escape, ghost!" Bob

16
00:01:09.489 --> 00:01:12.411
snapped. "The director will be here in a

17
00:01:12.412 --> 00:01:15.656
minute." The two guards each grabbed one of Ben's

18
00:01:15.657 --> 00:01:22.317
arms. Ben moaned. He knew he could float away from them, but what good would it

19
00:01:22.318 --> 00:01:30.944
do? He'd just wait for Mr. Freaky and Miss Bungle to arrive and explain

20
00:01:30.945 --> 00:01:38.424
everything. Soon Dr. Bones stomped through the construction and into the lobby.

21
00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:42.132
"What's going on here?" she demanded.

22
00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:46.611
"This ghost was stealing Egyptian jewelry," Hazel said.

23
00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:51.876
"But don't worry, Dr. Bones." She smiled proudly. "We caught him."

24
00:01:51.877 --> 00:01:55.919
"I didn't steal anything!" Ben protested.

25
00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.056
"Empty your pockets," Bob ordered.

26
00:01:59.057 --> 00:02:04.891
Ben did, but all he had was a gum wrapper and a few coins.

27
00:02:04.892 --> 00:02:08.858
"Where'd you put the jewels?" Bob demanded.

28
00:02:08.859 --> 00:02:12.355
"I didn't steal the jewels," Ben repeated.

29
00:02:12.356 --> 00:02:17.030
"But I saw who did. Like I said—it was two zombies!"

30
00:02:17.031 --> 00:02:20.736
"Where's Mr. Freaky?" Dr. Bones demanded.

31
00:02:20.737 --> 00:02:25.610
"I told Mayor Hubbletree that this monster visit would lead to trouble."

32
00:02:25.611 --> 00:02:28.125
She sneered at Ben.

33
00:02:28.126 --> 00:02:34.530
"But I didn't expect you monsters to steal museum treasures."

34
00:02:34.531 --> 00:02:39.139
Ben shook his head, trying to explain to the museum director now.

35
00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:43.351
"I saw some zombies. But they're not from Monster Academy!"

36
00:02:43.352 --> 00:02:46.346
Dr. Bones stared at Ben.

37
00:02:46.347 --> 00:02:53.180
"You're the only monsters here today. No monsters ever come to People Place."

38
00:02:53.181 --> 00:02:56.658
"Except for Uncle Tut," Ben muttered under his breath.

39
00:02:56.659 --> 00:03:01.926
But Dr. Bones had a good point. Where had the zombies come from?

40
00:03:01.927 --> 00:03:05.203
"We'll get to the bottom of this situation."

41
00:03:05.204 --> 00:03:10.916
Dr. Bones looked at the guards. "Bring this ghost to my office."

42
00:03:10.917 --> 00:03:15.610
"Yes, Dr. Bones," Bob said. "Should we call the police?"

43
00:03:15.611 --> 00:03:18.343
"No," Dr. Bones said quickly.

44
00:03:18.344 --> 00:03:21.304
"The museum doesn't need bad publicity.

45
00:03:21.305 --> 00:03:23.553
It's lucky I was working late.

46
00:03:23.554 --> 00:03:27.558
Bring the rest of the monsters too."

47
00:03:27.559 --> 00:03:35.429
The guards led Ben outside, taking the long way to Dr. Bones' office.

48
00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:46.609
The museum director unlocked doors with her keys as they went, relocking everything behind them.

49
00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:50.918
Soon Ben was sitting in a chair in Dr. Bones' office.

50
00:03:50.919 --> 00:03:57.005
Mr. Freaky paced up and down the director's office nervously.

51
00:03:57.006 --> 00:04:00.245
"Dr. Bones," the principal said.

52
00:04:00.246 --> 00:04:03.976
"Ben insists that some strangers stole the jewels.

53
00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:06.747
I'm sure he's telling the truth."

54
00:04:06.748 --> 00:04:11.905
Dr. Bones glared at Ben.

55
00:04:11.906 --> 00:04:16.770
"Where are these two zombies?" she demanded.

56
00:04:16.771 --> 00:04:23.794
She pointed to the hallway, where the rest of the monsters were lined up, looking sleepy and scared.

57
00:04:23.795 --> 00:04:28.416
"Do you see them out there?"

58
00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:31.814
Ben peered through the glass and then shook his head.

59
00:04:31.815 --> 00:04:36.249
"They're not there. At first I thought maybe the zombies were new students.

60
00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:40.005
But they are definitely not from Monster Academy."

61
00:04:40.006 --> 00:04:44.445
"There are exactly three zombies on this trip," Mr. Freaky said.

62
00:04:44.446 --> 00:04:48.306
"And they are all standing in the line outside!" The

63
00:04:48.307 --> 00:04:54.108
guards scowled. "That ghost is lying!" Hazel said. "Dr.

64
00:04:54.109 --> 00:05:00.305
Bones, we need to search everyone!" One

65
00:05:00.306 --> 00:05:10.684
by one, the guards made all the monsters come in and empty their sleeping bags, their backpacks, their lunchboxes, and their pockets. The

66
00:05:10.685 --> 00:05:21.541
monsters' belongings piled up. The

67
00:05:21.542 --> 00:05:31.537
guards found spell books, Mog's collection of comic books, Scary People Stories , and snacks—dried bat wings and crunchy spiders.

68
00:05:31.538 --> 00:05:35.845
But there were no Egyptian jewels.

69
00:05:35.846 --> 00:05:41.607
"Where did you stash the loot, ghost?" Bob demanded. "Confess!"

70
00:05:41.608 --> 00:05:45.019
"I didn't steal anything!" Ben insisted.

71
00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:48.300
"How many times do I have to tell you?"

72
00:05:48.301 --> 00:05:52.324
Mr. Freaky's noses were wiggling like mad.

73
00:05:52.325 --> 00:05:54.540
"Where's Mayor Hubbletree?

74
00:05:54.541 --> 00:05:58.208
This situation is totally out of control!"

75
00:05:58.209 --> 00:06:00.698
By now it was very late.

76
00:06:00.699 --> 00:06:03.517
Dr. Bones turned to the guards.

77
00:06:03.518 --> 00:06:06.425
She looked exhausted.

78
00:06:06.426 --> 00:06:11.292
"It's time to bring the suspect to the police station," she murmured.

79
00:06:11.293 --> 00:06:14.327
"I'll meet you there soon."

80
00:06:14.328 --> 00:06:17.791
"Okay, Dr. Bones," the guards said.

81
00:06:17.792 --> 00:06:20.954
Dr. Bones got her coat from a nearby rack.

82
00:06:20.955 --> 00:06:26.361
As she put it on, something fell out of her pocket and clattered to the floor.

83
00:06:26.362 --> 00:06:33.647
Everyone stared at the object—it was a glittering piece of golden jewelry!

